    id: 'pd-sonar-drone-pad', name: 'Distant Sonar Pad', ref: 'In the style of Brian Eno — "Signals" (Apollo: Atmospheres and Soundtracks)', artist: 'Brian Eno',
    tags: ['pad', 'ambient', '80s'], level: 2,
    blurb: 'Soft, slow notes that swell up over a low, still drone and fade away slowly.',
    how: 'Oscillator 4 is freed from the keys with OSC 4 CONTROL off, so it holds one low note while Oscillators 1 to 3 play sparse notes above it in POLY. Everything is triangle waves through a dark filter with a little emphasis, so each note has a faint ping inside its swell. Slow attacks and long fades let the notes overlap, and chorus II keeps the held sound slowly moving.',
